<v Mike>And I don't know zombies to have ever used the English language.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:52.680
<v Mike>So we can presume that your destruction has turned these zombies back to humans, or maybe these were the ones that didn't get turned yet, uh, which I thought.

00:12:52.820 --> 00:13:06.380
<v Mike>Didn't happen, but either way you, you can collect those guys and those power up your attacks as you collect, uh, more of the, um, the falling humans who are screaming for help.

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:07.780
<v Mike>And they fall kind of funny.

00:13:07.940 --> 00:13:18.420
<v Mike>Like they first, they're always like doing flips, but then they like launch up in the air really high and then like kind of slowly descend against the laws of physics back down.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:20.900
<v Mike>Like you have plenty of time to collect them.

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.300
<v Joe>And it's kind of like they're jumping, like they're not falling.

00:13:23.620 --> 00:13:24.520
<v Sean>Like they're jumping off.

00:13:24.640 --> 00:13:25.540
<v Sean>Yeah, exactly. Right, right.

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.740
<v Mike>Like they saw the explosion and they were like, I gotta get out of here.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:33.240
<v Mike>The life bar, this is a pretty good use of a life bar.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:34.800
<v Mike>You have, uh, what is it?

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.560
<v Mike>You have like nine, nine heads.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:39.240
<v Mike>And I guess those are like your nine lives.

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:48.440
<v Mike>And anytime you take damage, the head turns into a skull, but it still does like this chomping animation that the heads are doing.

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.500
