00:13:57.220 --> 00:14:05.640
<v Joe>I think I like, yeah, this is where I might disagree a little bit where at the sense that it's better because it is like unique and interesting.

00:14:06.100 --> 00:14:07.980
<v Joe>They're all, like you said, they're all moving.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:09.380
<v Joe>They're all doing this chomping animation.

