<v Joe>A lot of it's coming from the same color sprites.

00:14:48.120 --> 00:14:51.600
<v Joe>It gives me the vibe that this is a ROM hack.

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:54.180
<v Joe>This whole game feels very ROM hacky.

