<v Mike>And Joe, you know, you're probably experiencing so much damage because you might have forgotten you are a giant head.

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:18.820
<v Mike>So you have a giant hit box.

00:15:18.840 --> 00:15:21.700
<v Mike>Like it is really hard to not take damage in this game.

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:26.020
